{"name": "Wavecrashers", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>100% positive reviews on demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\"Quite polished for a demo, the hero kits feel distinct, build variety and the core wave-defense loop is tight and it's addictive. The foundation is strong and genuinely fun. Definitely keeping an eye on this one!\"</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"428\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/916b7d98c0f1d3283dfea3e956d7804e.avif?t=1787396050\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hordes of enemies spawn in waves to attempt to destroy the core building. Three players team up to defeat them and must endure to the final wave to win the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/082b7fffa205d642075eb0eb1dafcd50.poster.avif?t=1787396050\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/082b7fffa205d642075eb0eb1dafcd50.webm?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/082b7fffa205d642075eb0eb1dafcd50.mp4?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"720\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3d8d3e66868465c4eaa15e98cf701732.poster.avif?t=1787396050\" width=\"1280\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3d8d3e66868465c4eaa15e98cf701732.webm?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3d8d3e66868465c4eaa15e98cf701732.mp4?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"428\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/3c1a1af0bbd7954c86bc8383e01fbe29.avif?t=1787396050\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A selection of unique ideas is embodied in the characters. Players have the freedom to build their characters in various ways, going beyond the conventional tank, damage dealer and support roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like in a MOBA, heroes can be customized during the game by purchasing items to amplify their powers, unlock synergies, and evolve their playstyle as the battle unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"720\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b57b6b15098a91a576ff772da08595f2.poster.avif?t=1787396050\" width=\"1280\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b57b6b15098a91a576ff772da08595f2.webm?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/b57b6b15098a91a576ff772da08595f2.mp4?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/0f24f6cc39e69e85f8c5c8fb6a3b5262.poster.avif?t=1787396050\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/0f24f6cc39e69e85f8c5c8fb6a3b5262.webm?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/0f24f6cc39e69e85f8c5c8fb6a3b5262.mp4?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"428\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/45d4228388dbabbb3ac8b0c3cb3c06f1.avif?t=1787396050\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for the ultimate test in Hard Mode. Each time you defeat a few waves, you\u2019ll face a critical decision -choose from 3 increasingly difficult options to raise the stakes. You must win the round in order to unlock the next level of intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But fear not, your journey isn\u2019t without its rewards. Perks and advantages gained from account progression will stay active, giving you a better fighting chance to overcome tougher runs. If you think you\u2019ve mastered the normal game, Hard Mode will push your skills to the limit and demand every ounce of strategy and teamwork to succeed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your Path:</strong> After every few waves, you\u2019ll be given 3 random choices to increase the challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Victory is Essential:</strong> Only by winning each round will you earn the chance to face even more brutal challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression-fueled Power:</strong> Your account progression ensures that the perks and advantages you\u2019ve earned stay with you on Hard Mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/e404f7449c586156d800890dd64cf678.poster.avif?t=1787396050\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/e404f7449c586156d800890dd64cf678.webm?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/e404f7449c586156d800890dd64cf678.mp4?t=1787396050\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"337\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/extras/105f554e4389e326a46446a66d871096.avif?t=1787396050\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-op Gameplay: Form your trio and stand together against the enemy waves. <strong>Can be played with bots.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No Pay to Win:\u00a0All progression is earned through gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replayability:\u00a0Hard Mode's procedural gameplay keeps every run unpredictable and delivers a fresh challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for Fair Play:\u00a0Game's systems are built to prevent exploits and cheating.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three heroes. Endless waves. One chance to hold the line.</h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Hold the line or everything falls. Wavecrashers is a 3-player co-op strategy game where heroes defend against relentless waves of enemies. Build powerful synergies, push your limits, and survive the chaos. Play solo with bots or team up with friends. Every run is a fight to endure the storm.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664090/943e5dcdf3da4aa806f41eeea93321d8d10f6b34/header.jpg?t=1787396050", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy",